      "content": "thanks, i'll try the deep breathing. but about the aspirin... you said 325mg, but i saw some people online saying for actual clots you need way more to really make it work, like even several of those at once? i'm so scared that if i only take one, it won't be enough to keep the clot from moving to my lungs while i'm asleep.\n\nand what about the xarelto i mentioned? if i can just get a hold of some or even just a super high dose of aspirin like 1000mg or something, would that be a safer bet to make sure i don't have a disaster in the middle of the night? i just want to be certain i'm actually doing enough to stay safe until tomorrow morning.",
